Browser only (no API key)
export QUERY="dentists in Lahore"
export MAX_RESULTS=200
python maps_runner.py
# browser runs, if blocked → warns "no API key", writes whatever browser got

Hybrid (recommended):
export GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY="AIza..."
export QUERY="dentists in Lahore"
export MAX_RESULTS=300
python maps_runner.py
Docker-compose — add the key to the env block:

environment:
  - QUERY=dentists in Lahore
  - MAX_RESULTS=300
  - GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=AIza...
  - ROTATE_EVERY=150
volumes:
  - ./out:/app/out
cost / behavior notes
Scenario	Browser does	API does	Cost
Clean run, 300 results	all 300	nothing	$0
Blocked at landing, 300 wanted	0	300	~$5
Blocked at card 120, 300 wanted	120	180 top-up	~$3
No API key, blocked	whatever scraped	nothing	$0
No API key, clean	all	nothing	$0
The API caps at 60 results per query with Text Search. For top-ups above 60, split the query by neighborhood/postal and union — the dedupe pass handles overlaps.
